WEBVTT

00:08.790 --> 00:09.500
<b>Hamaminami Book store</b>

00:13.000 --> 00:16.000
<b>Komaru</b>

00:13.000 --> 00:16.000
<b>Fireworks Show</b>

00:16.000 --> 00:19.130
<b>Dreams</b>

00:16.000 --> 00:19.130
<b>are Short,</b>

00:16.000 --> 00:19.130
<b>Fall in Love,</b>

00:16.000 --> 00:19.130
<b>Maiden.</b>

00:16.710 --> 00:17.750
Sajo-kun.

00:18.880 --> 00:19.830
Sajo-kun!

00:20.750 --> 00:21.790
Is something wrong?

00:22.330 --> 00:24.170
It looks like it might rain, so...

00:25.130 --> 00:26.330
Oh, seriously?

00:30.540 --> 00:32.540
It does look like it might start raining...

00:33.380 --> 00:34.580
Oh, it's here.

00:34.920 --> 00:39.040
Ichinose-san, can you help me put away
the carts we have out front?

00:39.250 --> 00:41.000
U-understood.

00:47.290 --> 00:51.290
<b>We buy</b>

00:47.290 --> 00:51.290
<b>used books.</b>

00:57.420 --> 00:59.790
What!? N-Natsukawa!?

01:01.580 --> 01:03.460
U-um...

01:04.880 --> 01:07.210
Oh! Quickly! Inside!

01:15.670 --> 01:18.080
Natsukawa-san... Here you go.

01:23.880 --> 01:26.040
Thanks, Ichinose-san.

01:26.420 --> 01:27.170
You're welcome.

01:30.170 --> 01:32.960
Has something changed about Ichinose-san?

01:32.960 --> 01:35.420
Huh? Yeah, that might be.

01:35.710 --> 01:40.080
At first, she looks meek and mild, but actually,
she's really attentive and thoughtful, you know?

01:42.130 --> 01:43.500
What brought you here today?

01:44.500 --> 01:47.630
Oh... Well... I just dropped by to look in on you.

01:47.880 --> 01:50.380
You didn't have to come on a day
like this with this weather, though...

01:54.330 --> 01:57.830
At this rate, the distance will end up steadily
getting wider again, you know?

01:58.880 --> 02:01.210
Are you going to continue working
part-time from now on too?

02:01.210 --> 02:03.750
Huh? No, not for much longer.

02:03.750 --> 02:04.290
Huh?

02:04.830 --> 02:08.920
I'm quitting after summer break.
Since that was my original plan.

02:09.420 --> 02:13.040
I-is that so...? You okay with that?

02:13.580 --> 02:15.000
"Okay with that?", in what way?

02:15.920 --> 02:16.880
Well...

02:18.330 --> 02:23.290
Huh? You know, Ichinose-san is okay now.
Even if I'm not here for her.

02:30.670 --> 02:32.000
Hello!

02:33.170 --> 02:36.790
I almost made it here when it started raining and...

02:38.540 --> 02:40.710
Oh! Natsukawa-senpai!

02:40.710 --> 02:44.420
Oh. Yeah, hello. Or rather, your clothes!

02:44.420 --> 02:49.130
The fact that I was able to see you, here of all places!
Thank you very much for the other day!

02:49.130 --> 02:51.880
More importantly, your clothes. We've got to hurry and
get you dried off.

02:53.830 --> 02:55.790
I used this a little too, but...

02:56.130 --> 02:57.880
What!? Fuka-chan!?

02:58.130 --> 03:00.040
Mina-senpai, today, I-

03:00.040 --> 03:02.000
Oh! Here, come over here!

03:01.000 --> 03:02.790
Is something the matter?

03:04.210 --> 03:05.710
I'll watch the store, so...

03:06.420 --> 03:07.750
That was surprising.

03:07.750 --> 03:10.830
Huh? Oh, Sasaki-san?

03:11.580 --> 03:15.750
She and Ichinose-san get along well.
She comes here often, and they talk about books.

03:16.290 --> 03:17.290
"Often"...

03:17.670 --> 03:18.250
Yeah.

03:19.130 --> 03:24.000
You're awfully... close to both of them.
You sure you don't need to go over there?

03:24.170 --> 03:26.460
Well, Natsukawa, you'd end up by yourself.

03:29.330 --> 03:30.040
Natsukawa?

03:30.880 --> 03:31.830
What's wrong?

03:31.830 --> 03:33.500
I-it's nothing.

03:33.960 --> 03:35.790
No, it's definitely not nothing.

03:36.130 --> 03:37.630
I'm telling, you, it's nothing!

03:40.380 --> 03:42.380
Whoa! What're you...!?

03:58.540 --> 03:59.960
Oh! Um!

03:59.960 --> 04:03.880
We didn't intend to eavesdrop or take a peep,
or anything like that! Please excuse us!

04:08.710 --> 04:12.290
I-I told you; you know? I said,
"Want to come to my house?"

04:12.290 --> 04:14.380
Y-yeah. I remember.

04:14.670 --> 04:17.250
But you went out of your way
to come and say that again?

04:17.460 --> 04:21.000
Th-that's because by chance,
I just happened to come nearby, so...

04:21.750 --> 04:25.000
But earlier, you said something like you
"just dropped by to look in," you know?

04:25.000 --> 04:27.380
Is it necessary for you to go there?

04:27.580 --> 04:30.750
I'm sorry. I get caught up in the details, so...

04:34.080 --> 04:37.380
So, that "Want to come to my house?" thing,
is that still on?

04:37.880 --> 04:38.790
Why?

04:39.460 --> 04:43.380
Well, since there's been a lot of pointing out my faults,
so I thought for sure it'd been called off.

04:39.830 --> 04:44.960
<b>Dreams</b>

04:39.830 --> 04:44.960
<b>are Short,</b>

04:39.830 --> 04:44.960
<b>Fall in Love,</b>

04:39.840 --> 04:44.960
<b>Maiden.</b>

04:43.750 --> 04:44.960
That was...

04:45.170 --> 04:49.960
<b>So, if it was just me, then that's</b>

04:45.170 --> 04:49.960
<b>one thing, but Airi will be there.</b>

04:45.170 --> 04:49.960
<b>Sajo</b>

04:45.170 --> 04:49.960
<b>As you wish!</b>

04:45.170 --> 04:49.960
<b>Sajo</b>

04:45.170 --> 04:49.960
<b>Please</b>

04:45.170 --> 04:49.960
<b>I leave it to what you think is best.</b>

04:45.170 --> 04:49.960
<b>I mean it.</b>

04:45.290 --> 04:46.920
That was because...

04:47.210 --> 04:49.830
I wanted you to be Airi's kind older brother, so...

04:50.040 --> 04:51.670
What!? "Older brother"...!?

04:52.210 --> 04:53.130
That's not...!

04:53.380 --> 04:55.250
I didn't mean it in that way just now, so...!

04:55.250 --> 04:57.250
I know! I know that!

05:01.500 --> 05:03.630
You know, I really do want you to come over.

05:15.630 --> 05:18.080
I'm also, looking forward to-

05:19.290 --> 05:20.420
Uh...

05:38.000 --> 05:41.960
<b>The Dreaming Boy</b>

05:38.000 --> 05:41.960
<b>is a Realist</b>

05:42.080 --> 05:47.670
Nozoki dasu sora no gourei de omoi kakaeta mama shuppatsu

05:47.670 --> 05:52.380
Me wa au noni kaze de yurete toomawari

05:53.460 --> 05:58.960
Akogare matataki no shutter omoide wa kokoro kazatta

05:58.960 --> 06:04.380
Kono jikan, suki mitai modokashii noni

06:05.420 --> 06:10.290
Hanarete chikazuite akirame kaketa yume

06:10.540 --> 06:15.960
Umaku oritateru hi oikakete mitaina

06:15.960 --> 06:21.380
Joukuu ippai ni natta tsutae kirenai koto

06:21.540 --> 06:27.170
Nazeka iro chigai no kimi no honne surechigatta

06:27.170 --> 06:35.460
Mayotchai sou dakedo sora wa zutto futatsu no kodou

06:35.460 --> 06:38.000
Nando mo tsutaeta

06:38.170 --> 06:44.170
Ao no kanjou kuttsuke tara donna keshiki hirogaru no kana

06:44.170 --> 06:48.830
Irodotta omoi shiritainda

06:55.750 --> 06:58.750
<b>Because, You are Where I Belong!</b>

06:57.000 --> 07:01.500
<b>Natsukawa</b>

07:02.290 --> 07:03.540
The time has come.

07:05.250 --> 07:07.250
What're you doing, Sajotchi?

07:07.250 --> 07:08.210
Whoa!

07:12.040 --> 07:14.920
I mean, "fine feathers make fine birds"?

07:14.920 --> 07:16.250
Zero points.

07:16.460 --> 07:19.000
What!? But I praised you properly.

07:19.330 --> 07:21.250
Wow, that makes me so happy.

07:24.460 --> 07:25.630
Hang on!

07:25.630 --> 07:27.290
I haven't mentally prepared myself yet!

07:27.460 --> 07:28.380
Coming!

07:33.420 --> 07:34.130
Ugh.

07:35.540 --> 07:39.290
Minus one hundred million points.
At least put it into words.

07:39.420 --> 07:40.290
Come in.

07:41.710 --> 07:43.330
Kei-chan, and...

07:44.250 --> 07:45.250
Who're you?

07:46.460 --> 07:50.830
It is nice to meet you. My name is Wataru Sajo.
I look forward to today.

07:50.830 --> 07:52.710
Don't do a formal greeting.

07:52.710 --> 07:56.420
Ai-chan, this person is called "Wataru."

07:56.420 --> 07:58.290
Wataru. Can you say that?

07:58.540 --> 07:59.630
Watau...?

07:59.630 --> 08:01.960
Aw, jeez! You're so cute!

08:03.420 --> 08:06.460
Ai-chan, maybe it's easier instead to say, Sajo?

08:06.670 --> 08:07.670
Sajo?

08:09.170 --> 08:10.210
Sajo!

08:13.920 --> 08:15.580
Go! Sajo!

08:15.880 --> 08:17.170
Onward!

08:17.170 --> 08:18.670
Y-yessir!

08:21.750 --> 08:24.670
I underestimated five year-olds...
She's way too energetic!

08:24.960 --> 08:27.580
More, more! Too slow, Sajo!

08:29.330 --> 08:30.920
Hey, you okay?

08:33.210 --> 08:35.330
I-I'm okay...

08:35.630 --> 08:38.130
I wanna ride the horse!

08:37.420 --> 08:40.210
Airi, don't act spoiled and demand too much.

08:41.250 --> 08:45.830
Airi-san, do you always do this kind of hardcore playing?

08:46.250 --> 08:47.000
Huh?

08:47.330 --> 08:51.040
Usually, she reads picture books or
plays house and stuff like that, but...

08:51.290 --> 08:54.500
Lucky! You've totally gained her favor.

08:54.500 --> 08:56.130
What? You think so?

08:56.130 --> 08:57.080
Boom!

08:57.080 --> 08:58.000
Whoa!

08:58.170 --> 08:59.000
See?

08:58.670 --> 08:59.750
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

08:59.880 --> 09:02.880
U-usually she doesn't like jump on people like this, but...

09:01.420 --> 09:02.880
Hey! That's...!

09:02.880 --> 09:07.380
Sajotchi is a younger brother, right?
There's probably something she feels she connects with.

09:05.420 --> 09:07.750
That's my stomach!

09:08.130 --> 09:09.880
Even so, to this extent?

09:11.710 --> 09:14.670
Hey you! This is Sajo's overthrow of his superior!

09:14.670 --> 09:15.210
Oh no!

09:15.210 --> 09:16.250
Take that! And that! And that!

09:16.500 --> 09:19.920
It's refreshing that Ai-chan isn't being
shy of strangers and going all wild.

09:20.540 --> 09:22.130
Is this Sajotchi's power, maybe?

09:22.460 --> 09:23.130
Yeah...

09:23.130 --> 09:23.830
Sajo!
Take that!<b></b>

09:26.460 --> 09:29.380
Yeah... This is fun...

09:30.080 --> 09:32.960
You're like worn out, Sajotchi. That's hilarious.

09:33.290 --> 09:35.420
Well, you're the one who
went all out to go along with her.

09:35.580 --> 09:39.920
But Natsukawa, you said so yourself, right?
That you wanted me "to be Airi's kind older brother."

09:40.130 --> 09:42.080
Hey! Here is not the place for that!

09:42.080 --> 09:43.130
"Older brother"?

09:43.750 --> 09:46.420
Huh!? What's that? What're you talking about?

09:46.580 --> 09:49.830
Well, when it was decided that we were
going to hang out at Natsukawa's house-

09:49.830 --> 09:51.920
E-enough about that!

09:51.920 --> 09:54.000
What!? But I'm curious!

09:54.000 --> 09:55.420
I'm curious!

09:55.420 --> 09:57.290
Kei! You too, Airi!

09:57.540 --> 10:00.710
Uh-oh! We got scolded! Ai-chan, come over here!

10:01.380 --> 10:02.290
Okay!

10:02.630 --> 10:04.540
So cute! So cute!

10:05.920 --> 10:09.630
Aichi, same as Ai-chan, you had a time
in your life like this too, you know?

10:09.960 --> 10:13.290
In other words, you mean she's
like Natsukawa, when she was little.

10:13.630 --> 10:15.460
Don't look at this in a weird way.

10:17.290 --> 10:18.750
Same as Big Sis?

10:19.040 --> 10:20.040
That's right!

10:20.540 --> 10:24.040
A Natsukawa cheerfully frolicking... Hmm...

10:20.710 --> 10:23.170
Same as Big Sis!

10:25.080 --> 10:27.380
You're not thinking something weird, are you?

10:27.380 --> 10:30.290
N-n-no! It's not like that, okay?

10:30.750 --> 10:32.830
You're acting way too agitated, you know?

10:35.130 --> 10:36.460
What, Kei?

10:36.460 --> 10:37.540
Nothing.

10:37.920 --> 10:38.960
Hey, hey, Ai-chan.

10:38.960 --> 10:39.500
Huh?

10:39.500 --> 10:43.250
Don't you want a big brother?
A big brother who'll play with you every day.

10:43.460 --> 10:45.420
I want! A big brother!

10:46.130 --> 10:46.750
Oh!

10:47.000 --> 10:49.750
Wh-what're you saying!?
What's with the "big brother" thing!?

10:49.920 --> 10:56.000
Oh my. What I was talking about, is in the sense of
a young man who's older than her, you know?

10:56.210 --> 10:57.880
Honestly! C'mon, Kei!

11:00.040 --> 11:01.670
Sajo! You rested up?

11:01.920 --> 11:03.630
Yeah, rested up. I'm rested up.

11:03.630 --> 11:05.080
Then let's play!

11:05.080 --> 11:06.790
What!? Whoa, whoa!

11:10.380 --> 11:12.630
I am burned-out. To pure white ash.

11:13.880 --> 11:14.920
Oh! Aichi's mom.

11:15.130 --> 11:15.710
What!?

11:16.750 --> 11:18.210
What're you doing?

11:18.210 --> 11:19.920
Plus, the posed look is pointless.

11:20.670 --> 11:21.920
Welcome home, Mom.

11:22.130 --> 11:24.670
I'm home. Are there guests?

11:25.670 --> 11:26.960
Yeah. Kei and-

11:26.960 --> 11:28.080
A pleasure to meet you.

11:29.040 --> 11:30.460
What're you doing!?

11:31.420 --> 11:33.540
You must be Sajo-kun, right?

11:34.000 --> 11:34.540
What!?

11:34.920 --> 11:36.960
I've heard stories about you from Aika.

11:36.960 --> 11:38.580
What!? What stories!?

11:38.580 --> 11:39.330
Huh!?

11:39.580 --> 11:40.920
Let's see...

11:41.960 --> 11:44.210
Th-they were about to leave, so...!

11:47.960 --> 11:52.920
That's too bad. I wanted to have
a long thorough talk with Sajo-kun.

11:52.920 --> 11:53.830
Sajo!

11:54.000 --> 11:55.500
Um, well...

11:55.670 --> 11:56.830
Mom!

11:57.130 --> 11:59.080
Next time... It can be next time, okay!?

11:59.290 --> 12:00.000
What...?

12:00.330 --> 12:04.830
You did it, Sajotchi. Apparently,
there's going to be a next time. A next time.

12:05.170 --> 12:06.460
Y-yeah...

12:07.290 --> 12:09.040
I'm going to escort them!

12:09.830 --> 12:13.290
Yes, yes. Sajo-kun, please come again.

12:13.830 --> 12:17.000
Airi-chan, next time, please take it
easy on me, just a little bit more.

12:17.000 --> 12:18.920
See ya, Ai-chan!

12:19.210 --> 12:21.130
See ya!

12:26.830 --> 12:29.290
Ai-chan is growing fast, more and more.

12:29.290 --> 12:32.380
You think so? Since I see her every day, I can't tell.

12:32.790 --> 12:35.420
Before long, she might grow taller than you, Aichi.

12:35.420 --> 12:38.540
E-even I will still grow a little bit taller!

12:38.540 --> 12:39.380
What!?

12:39.830 --> 12:42.880
Speaking of, Airi-chan takes after her mom, you know?

12:43.210 --> 12:47.420
Hmm, I guess so. Aichi, if I had to say,
you take after your dad, right?

12:47.710 --> 12:49.960
A beautiful mama and beautiful sisters, huh?

12:49.960 --> 12:52.420
Hey, don't say it in a weird way like that.

12:52.580 --> 12:56.080
What!? Did I say it in a weird way? Uh, really?

12:56.420 --> 12:58.000
Oh! Anyway, Natsukawa.

12:58.380 --> 13:00.040
What did you say about me?

13:00.040 --> 13:00.710
What!?

13:01.290 --> 13:03.830
Your mom had said she'd heard stories about me.

13:04.290 --> 13:06.540
I-I didn't particularly talk about anything.

13:06.540 --> 13:07.170
Oh!

13:07.170 --> 13:10.170
Oh! I'm this way, so, bye-bye!

13:10.170 --> 13:10.920
Oh!

13:12.080 --> 13:13.250
She just...

13:14.170 --> 13:16.750
Here's fine. Thanks, Natsukawa.

13:18.130 --> 13:20.210
I'll escort you, just a little further.

13:20.460 --> 13:21.420
Might as well.

13:21.710 --> 13:23.170
Oh! Hey...!

13:26.040 --> 13:30.040
<b>The Dreaming Boy</b>

13:26.040 --> 13:30.040
<b>is a Realist</b>

13:37.080 --> 13:41.210
You know, lately, school has been fun.

13:41.210 --> 13:42.580
What? School?

13:43.790 --> 13:47.540
I started talking to a lot of people
and I started hanging out and...

13:47.880 --> 13:51.500
It's like, "Oh, so this is what school life is like."

13:54.630 --> 13:57.880
But it's not like it happened naturally, you know?

13:57.880 --> 13:58.580
Huh?

13:58.750 --> 14:02.080
Well, because when I was in middle school,
it wasn't like "this."

14:04.380 --> 14:05.040
Oh!

14:06.420 --> 14:10.830
M-my bad... That was my fault, wasn't it?

14:11.460 --> 14:14.170
That's not what I'm saying. It's not that.

14:15.250 --> 14:20.380
At that time, Wataru, even if you weren't there,
I probably couldn't have enjoyed school,

14:20.670 --> 14:23.880
or like talked to classmates. Because I didn't
have the emotional leeway for stuff like that.

14:24.670 --> 14:27.460
Because I couldn't shift my focus to other stuff.

14:32.330 --> 14:34.790
You're still up? Go to bed already.

14:35.630 --> 14:37.250
I just happened to wake up.

14:39.880 --> 14:43.960
So, Mom, I'm thinking of taking
the entrance exam for Koetsu High School.

14:44.830 --> 14:47.710
That place has a tuition exemption program, you know?

14:47.710 --> 14:50.750
Oh! What're you saying? You don't have to worry-

14:50.750 --> 14:51.380
Plus...

14:52.000 --> 14:53.580
The uniforms are cute.

14:58.750 --> 14:59.630
I see...

15:01.040 --> 15:05.880
I still feel regretful about things, after all.
I must've been unbearably in the way.

15:05.880 --> 15:06.670
That's true.

15:06.670 --> 15:07.290
Oof!

15:07.580 --> 15:08.420
But...

15:08.670 --> 15:13.210
Based on the me at that time,
I sort of can't believe who I am now.

15:13.670 --> 15:16.540
It's like, "how am I able to have
fun doing things to this extent...?"

15:17.170 --> 15:19.290
Probably, the start of it was...

15:20.750 --> 15:22.830
He hasn't been making passes at you lately, you know?

15:23.250 --> 15:25.380
Natsukawa-san, I'm glad.

15:25.710 --> 15:27.500
You see, we'd been a little concerned.

15:28.710 --> 15:30.920
Everyone knew about me.

15:31.420 --> 15:35.830
Probably, if I hadn't had that, then I would've stayed
the same as when I was a middle schooler.

15:36.750 --> 15:42.420
That's because of my support and promotion activities,
so to speak. But regardless, I'm sorry.

15:42.750 --> 15:45.330
I'm telling you, don't apologize, Wataru.

15:45.710 --> 15:47.500
Because I'm being self-indulgent too.

15:47.500 --> 15:48.380
In what way?

15:48.880 --> 15:51.920
Even with Kei, or like when I'm
with everyone having fun talking,

15:52.170 --> 15:53.710
I feel there's something lacking.

15:54.000 --> 15:54.830
Well...

15:55.960 --> 15:57.630
That might be self-indulgent.

15:58.040 --> 16:01.880
You see, at times like that, without fail,
a certain someone isn't there.

16:02.380 --> 16:05.880
And that certain someone, is there,
a step away in the distance.

16:06.290 --> 16:07.790
Well, that's because...

16:08.380 --> 16:11.540
If I stepped into that, then I might get in the way, so...

16:11.880 --> 16:13.040
That's not true!

16:15.330 --> 16:16.330
Because...

16:19.670 --> 16:20.670
Because...

16:21.170 --> 16:24.830
Because, you are where I belong!

16:32.630 --> 16:33.630
Natsuka-

16:51.080 --> 16:52.540
Oh, today is...

16:54.290 --> 16:55.460
the fireworks show.

17:01.630 --> 17:02.710
Sorry...

17:03.000 --> 17:04.750
Huh!? Y-yeah...

17:07.580 --> 17:10.210
I don't do well with loud noises.

17:13.710 --> 17:15.130
N-Natsukawa?

17:19.710 --> 17:22.830
Are you not going to call me by my first name anymore?

17:23.500 --> 17:24.380
What...?

17:25.420 --> 17:26.420
Oh! F...

17:27.080 --> 17:28.290
Forget what I just said!

17:30.040 --> 17:34.420
B-but... You have to come talk to me like before.

17:34.960 --> 17:36.540
You know, I get thrown off...

17:37.210 --> 17:38.540
if you're not there with me!

17:40.960 --> 17:42.710
O-okay...

19:04.170 --> 19:06.540
Aika looked young to me, more than usual.

19:07.960 --> 19:12.750
I couldn't leave her alone, so while Aika had said
she'd escort me, it ended up that I escorted her home.

19:13.630 --> 19:16.080
That being said, that might've been an excuse.

19:18.880 --> 19:19.710
Well then.

19:22.630 --> 19:25.170
Thanks... Wataru.

19:26.000 --> 19:27.670
See you, Aika.

19:31.540 --> 19:33.540
<b>September 1</b>

19:34.540 --> 19:37.040
There you go, hassling me only at times like this!

19:37.210 --> 19:41.540
Why not? You've gotten to the point where
you're good at doing the work for the school,

19:41.880 --> 19:45.040
so, keep up the good work, and
help out with the culture festival.

19:45.380 --> 19:46.330
I don't want to.

19:46.330 --> 19:47.130
Ow!

19:48.580 --> 19:53.580
Alright, I got it! Don't mysteriously grab onto
my shoulder and wrist! You're way too scary!

19:57.540 --> 19:58.250
Tch!

20:02.540 --> 20:08.750
That violent woman, she's totally gotten a taste
of taking advantage. I'm not a damn handyman.

20:09.380 --> 20:10.080
Huh?

20:19.380 --> 20:21.080
Morning, Wataru.

20:21.460 --> 20:23.210
Morning, Natsukawa.

20:27.880 --> 20:29.250
Huh? What's that...?

20:29.960 --> 20:31.960
Your tie is crooked.

20:39.080 --> 20:41.880
It's the new school term, so get yourself together!

20:42.290 --> 20:44.000
U-understood.

20:44.710 --> 20:45.790
Your hair too.

20:46.330 --> 20:47.960
Y-you don't have to do my hair.

20:47.960 --> 20:48.540
Oh...

20:52.630 --> 20:55.170
See? It's fixed. Let's go.

20:55.170 --> 20:55.880
Okay.

21:07.630 --> 21:09.250
Oh, did you get a haircut?

21:10.420 --> 21:12.040
I didn't get it cut; you know?

21:12.040 --> 21:13.540
Oh, I see...

21:14.130 --> 21:14.880
Jeez...

21:42.580 --> 21:45.040
Mou, shitsukoi! Danante, ne

21:45.330 --> 21:48.580
Aa. Iwanakya yokatta na...

21:49.420 --> 21:55.580
Demo ne nande sona kyuu ni sokkenai kao shite kuruno...

21:57.290 --> 21:59.500
Kidoku no mama oitekebori na message

21:59.500 --> 22:01.790
Demo group dato henshin aru mitai na

22:02.000 --> 22:03.960
Chikai to omottara tooku natte

22:04.210 --> 22:05.750
Nande konna sabishin daro

22:05.750 --> 22:07.630
Kyou wa oikakete... kurenai no?

22:07.630 --> 22:09.170
Sunao ni naretara ii noni

22:10.630 --> 22:16.960
Datte hajimete shitta no konna setsunai kimochi ga aru kototte...

22:16.960 --> 22:18.380
Nanoni, nee!

22:18.380 --> 22:19.920
Doushite itchau no??

22:19.920 --> 22:21.670
Nande naisho nano!?

22:21.880 --> 22:24.040
Modokashii darake de...

22:24.040 --> 22:25.420
Aa! Aa!

22:25.420 --> 22:27.130
Ienai yo konna no

22:27.130 --> 22:31.080
Dakedo sakki wa honne janai kara

22:31.080 --> 22:32.460
Tsutawatte yo

22:32.540 --> 22:34.210
Doushite okotchau no...

22:34.210 --> 22:35.750
Kawaiku dekinai no...

22:35.750 --> 22:38.210
Kirai ni natta no...??

22:38.380 --> 22:41.080
Aa! Aa! A, aa!

22:43.080 --> 22:44.040
Doushite

22:44.710 --> 22:46.000
Kirai ni naranai de

22:49.040 --> 22:50.420
...Kiite, "Anone...!"

22:55.540 --> 22:58.580
So, even if I wish and have a dream,
reality is just meaningless.

22:59.420 --> 23:03.170
At that moment, starting with when
the soccer ball blew past, right in front of me,

23:03.170 --> 23:05.830
the view that I could see turned gray.

23:06.750 --> 23:09.710
But, before I knew it, it had changed back to color again.

23:08.330 --> 23:10.330
<b>Morals &</b>

23:08.330 --> 23:10.330
<b>Discipline</b>

23:10.790 --> 23:12.290
It may just be coincidence...

23:12.670 --> 23:15.880
But by seeing reality and
by feverishly spending the days...

23:16.290 --> 23:19.630
That was the answer to how
I was going to get closer to that dream.

23:18.130 --> 23:20.130
<b>Student Council Room</b>

23:20.130 --> 23:22.130
<b>Student</b>

23:20.130 --> 23:22.130
<b>Council</b>

23:22.420 --> 23:24.330
My name is Wataru Sajo.

23:24.630 --> 23:28.460
I am at the mercy of my dreams and reality,
and I don't have the emotional leeway to look ahead.

23:28.790 --> 23:30.920
I am your commonplace male high school student.

23:34.250 --> 23:41.080
<b>The Dreaming Boy</b>

23:34.250 --> 23:41.080
<b>is a Realist</b>

23:35.540 --> 23:39.630
Most likely, I think my days will
continue to go on like this forever.
